### Obtener todos los usuarios (Solo admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/users
x-auth: admin_auth

###

### Registrar nuevo usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alan Casino",
  "email": "alan@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### Login de usuario (loginUser)
POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alan@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### Obtener un usuario por ID (Reemplaza ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/68090daec78d1be4c03f29eb

###

### Actualizar un usuario (PATCH) (Reemplaza ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/68090daec78d1be4c03f29eb
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alan Modificado",
  "email": "alanmodificado@example.com",
  "password": "87654321"
}

###

### Eliminar usuario (DELETE) 
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/68090daec78d1be4c03f29eb